Information security — credentials (INFOSEC-03)

Issuer: Moser Slovakia s. r. o. · IČO 47 556 210 · Twin City C, Mlynské nivy 12, 821 09 Bratislava

Effective: 18 August 2026  
Owner: Information Security, Moser Slovakia s. r. o.

Passwords, API keys and service credentials are classified Restricted. Employees must not share passwords, API keys or credentials with vendors, with colleagues, or by pasting them into a ticket.

- INFOSEC-03 requires every API key to live in the approved secrets vault.
- Rotate an API key immediately if it was pasted into chat or e-mail.
- SSO with multi-factor authentication is mandatory for every production console.

Never share an API key, not even with a trusted vendor engineer. Ask Vendor Access to issue a scoped, time-limited credential instead.

Report suspected phishing to Information Security within one hour.

S pozdravom
